@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@managerToken = demo-manager
@technicianToken = demo-technician

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### TC-02 - Nhap kho: so luong bang 0 phai bi tu choi
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/stock-receipts
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "part_id": 1,
  "quantity": 0
}

### TC-03 - Nhap kho: thieu linh kien phai bi tu choi
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/stock-receipts
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 1
}

### TC-04 - Xem ton kho cua trung tam dang nhap
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/part-stocks?page=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

### TC-05 - Kiem tra ton truoc khi xuat
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/parts/1/availability?requested_quantity=1
Authorization: Bearer {{technicianToken}}

### TC-11 - Phan trang khong hop le phai bi tu choi
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/part-stocks?page=0&size=101
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

### OWASP A07 - Khong gui token phai tra 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/part-stocks
